{
  "id": "vp.oidf.dcapi.multisigned.basic.001",
  "description": "The multi-signed request object on the Digital Credentials API channel (RFC 7515 \u00a77.2, the JWS JSON Serialization): both signatures valid, the client_id riding the signatures' protected headers (each cert's binding) \u2014 the wallet parses, presents, and never POSTs (\u00a78.4).",
  "provenance": "oidf",
  "generator": {
    "repo": "sirosfoundation/siros-wallet-core",
    "commit": "3a94dfd2768d0c547e77b40a58b7c197a1e70fca",
    "date": "2026-11-10"
  },
  "spec_refs": [
    "RFC 7515 section 7.2 (the JWS JSON Serialization)",
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 8.4 (the Digital Credentials API response modes)",
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 5.2.3 (the x509_hash client_id scheme \u2014 the leaf DER's base64url SHA-256)"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "time": 1700000000,
    "entropy_seed": 42,
    "pdp": {
      "trusted": true,
      "decision": "in the registry"
    }
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "wmp_in": {
        "method": "wmp.flow.start",
        "params": {
          "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
          "flow_type": "oid4vp",
          "params": {
            "request": "{\"payload\":\"\",\"signatures\":[{\"protected\":\"\",\"signature\":\"MEQCIAqjKPWvpVjBMu1gyHAPcEbxp3XV5cQ-aIHrLR-kNV5iAiA5C90DJ36QW-lIddSXdal_n_iL1Ilhp3tiF5HtLo5bFw\"},{\"protected\":\"\",\"signature\":\"MEQCICof4ixxMULmwW09IAFbLw1NFTqqkwIObIm8y7XiQHWvAiBMXH2AtOX1SPzunya-YvglGllHDbFeltKDxXQ2MG_eeg\"}]}",
            "origin": "https://verifier.example"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "match"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "selections": [
              {
                "credential_query_id": "pid-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-pid-1",
                "disclosed_claims": [
                  "[\"given_name\"]"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "consent"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "consented": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "presentation",
          "inputs": {
            "origin": "https://verifier.example"
          }
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "vp_token": "vp-token-ms-001"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://verifier.example/*",
          "purpose": "DirectPost",
          "must_refuse": true
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {}
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "parsing_request"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "request_parsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "evaluating_verifier_trust"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "trust_evaluated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "transaction_data_validated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "credential_selection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "submitting_response"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "step": "response_returned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.complete",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-dcapi-ms-001",
            "result": {
              "presented": true,
              "credential_ids": [
                "cred-pid-1"
              ],
              "dc_api_response": {
                "vp_token": "{\"pid-query\":[\"vp-token-ms-001\"]}"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Suite-validated on 2026-11-10: the dc_api module group's multisigned group (oid4vp-1final-wallet-haip-test-plan, sd_jwt_vc / eudi_pid / x509_hash / dc_api.jwt / request_uri_multisigned) green against the engine (plan DVGvjpRfRL20v, suite 5.3.4; the evidence is archived in siros-conformance/results/mini-wallet-vp-dcapi/2026-11-10/ and on the Pages site under runs/mini-wallet-vp-dcapi-2026-11-10). The general JWS is the suite's own verifier key material: signature 1 the client's key/cert, signature 2 the client2 fixture's (both in siros-conformance's vp-wallet-haip-config.json); the client_id is the x509_hash of cert 1's leaf, matching the suite's env. PLACEHOLDER_GENERAL_JWS is substituted at authoring time with the generated artifact (the payload/protected/signature texts embedded verbatim)."
}
